{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國上議院議員Jane Campbell（右）患有脊髓肌肉萎縮症，說話能力受影響，她周二（13日）透過AI重現生病前的聲音發表演說，讀出自己寫的講辭，成為國會首名使用AI生成語音發言的議員。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.451741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T11:20:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T12:17:39.807657+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416728+00:00","content_hash":"5bca818a98837d54260793ab5bfc386768701b681ad511adf554bfec17a20073","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}